    "title": "Yes, And Dragons with Improv Lore",
    "excerpt": "An Improvised Dungeons &amp; Dragons Adventure – Live on Stage! \n\nWhat happens when a group of brave (and slightly clueless) adventurers set out on a quest… and the dice, and YOU decide their fate? \nThis isn’t your usua&hellip;",
    "full_content": "An Improvised Dungeons & Dragons Adventure – Live on Stage!\nWhat happens when a group of brave (and slightly clueless) adventurers set out on a quest… and the dice, and YOU decide their fate?\nThis isn’t your usual D&D session. This is long-form improv meets chaotic fantasy:\nThe audience creates the world, from the tavern to the Big Bad Evil Guy.\nGiant D20 rolls determine whether our heroes triumph or spectacularly fail.\nPlot twists? You can throw them in anytime. (Yes, you can make the wizard speak only in rhymes if you want.)\nExpect ridiculous characters, epic fails, and critical laughs as our improvisers battle monsters, solve puzzles, and desperately try to survive whatever wild curveballs you throw their way.\nBring your best quest ideas, your loudest laugh, and maybe some bardic inspiration. Because in this adventure, the dice and you decide the story.",
