    "title": "Make Friends with the Stage: Open Stage Jam by Improv Lore",
    "excerpt": "The Open Stage Jam is where you get to step in and play, and try your hand at doing some improv on stage! \nWe’ll set up simple scenes and scenarios, guide you, and keep things moving so you’re never left figuring it &hellip;",
    "full_content": "The Open Stage Jam is where you get to step in and play, and try your hand at doing some improv on stage!\nWe’ll set up simple scenes and scenarios, guide you, and keep things moving so you’re never left figuring it out on your own. You can jump in for a scene or two, try something new, and step back whenever you like.\nIt’s a space that’s designed to be easy to enter, and built for taking small risks. You might come in just to watch, but we’re hoping you’ll leave having played.",
